type: software
title: "Safe Hands DB: a relational database for an insurance company"
abstract: >-
  PostgreSQL schema, migrations, seed data, ten business-scenario queries,
  tests and an in-browser demo for a fictional insurance company. Rebuilt from
  a 2022 university database design project, with every defect of the
  original documented and fixed.
